          "audio": "/lessons/exponential-graphs-am/scene-01-b8.mp3",
          "timing": "/lessons/exponential-graphs-am/scene-01-b8.timing.json"
        },
        {
          "say": "So it has the shape of E to the X, from the corner. Lift it onto the axes.",
